  "description": "\"My knife, I want to go home...home...home? go home!\"\n\nThis person who suffers from the constant repetition of corporate life. On the day of a dinner, a momentary mistake shakes the peaceful daily life. He showed at the end of the night dancing mercilessly, walking into a cafe as is... \n\n'It's different, but it's good.' Jane and James, the cafe's owners, are attracted to this person. Since that day, the unfamiliar feelings of two people towards that person add up, leaving her dizzy.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Webtoon](https://comic.naver.com/webtoon/list?titleId=799557), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=8810832)",
